actic breast biopsy</article-title><source>Eur J Radiol</source><year>2003</year><volume>47</volume><fpage>232</fpage><lpage>236</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12927668</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0720-048X(02)00196-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Al-Attar</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Michell</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ralleigh</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Wasan</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Bose</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Akbar</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The impact of image guided needle biopsy on the outcome of mammographically detected indeterminate microcalcification</article-title><source>Breast</source><year>2006</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>635</fpage><lpage>639</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16488148</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.breast.2005.12.004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schulz</surname><given-names>KD</given-names></name><name><surname>Albert</surname><given-names>US</given-names></name><name><surname>al.</surname><given-names/></name></person-group><source>Stufe-3-Leitlinie Brustkrebs-Fr&#x000fc;herkennung in Deutschland </source><year>2003</year><publisher-name> W. Zuckerschwerdt Verlag M&#x000fc;nchen</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hahn</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Krainick</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Peisker</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Krapfl</surname><given-names>